  "steps": [
    "Place the eggs in a saucepan, cover with water, and bring to a boil. Cook for 9–10 minutes until hard-boiled, then drain and cool under cold water before peeling.",
    "While the eggs cook, char the peppers in a hot dry pan or under a grill until blistered and softened. Let them cool slightly, then slice into strips.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the tuna, sliced peppers, red onion, and tomato.",
    "Whisk together the olive oil, vinegar, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper. Pour over the salad and toss gently.",
    "Slice the peeled eggs into wedges and arrange on top. Finish with chopped parsley and serve immediately or chill briefly before serving."
